            "text": "Attached is the initial draft of the Media Holding Statements and Q&A Library (A3), covering the scenarios we decided on. I've also mapped out a proposed multi-channel strategy (A5) for review. This covers T4 and T7. The core principle is a 'single source of truth' approach, but the tone and cadence will vary by channel.",
