            "speaker_id": 409854,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "A mixed approach seems best. We could do live sessions for key teams like security and front-line managers, and then share a recording for everyone else, with a mandatory confirmation of viewing. This also ties into the simulation drills we need to plan for T9.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
