            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 143124,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "I'd advocate for the live sessions to be interactive, scenario-based workshops rather than simple lectures. That's where the real learning happens for this kind of procedural training. The recording can then capture the core content.",
